# Keep these committed (do NOT ignore):
#   predictions/locked/    — locked predictions, immutable audit trail
#   predictions/tracking/  — forward-test tracking records
#   watchlist/history/     — historical recommendations archive
#   playbooks/             — analysis workflows
#   templates/             — output templates
#   config/                — config files (except .env)
